new file mode 100644
index 0000000..bba9bc8
--- /dev/null
+++ b/releasenotes/notes/fix-compose-plain-callable-07475600019ab06e.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+---
+fixes:
+  - |
+    Fixed composing a retry strategy with a plain callable using ``|`` or ``&``.
+    ``retry_if_exception_type(IOError) | my_predicate`` raised
+    ``AttributeError`` instead of producing a ``retry_any``, and the same
+    applied to ``&`` producing ``retry_all``. Composition with plain callables
+    works again for sync strategies. Type annotations for the composition
+    operators and for ``retry_any`` and ``retry_all`` now accept plain callables.
